{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type LitFormType<TOptions> = TOptions extends FormOptions<infer TFormData, infer TFormValidators, infer TSubmitReturn, unknown> ? TanStackFormController<TFormData, TFormValidators, LitFormTypeSubmitReturn<TSubmitReturn>> : never;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/lit-form/src/get-form-type.ts#L58","children":[{"type":"text","value":"get-form-type.ts:58"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Derives the Lit form controller type represented by a reusable options\nobject."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use it to type child element properties and render helpers that belong to one\nknown form shape. Options such as "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSubmit"},{"type":"text","value":" can be defined either in the\nshared options or when the form is created in the component."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"toptions","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TOptions"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AnyFormOptions"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The reusable form options from which the controller derives its form data, validator, and submit-result types."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const profileOptions = formOptions({\n  defaultValues: { name: '' },\n})\n\ntype ProfileForm = LitFormType<typeof profileOptions>\n\nfunction nameField(form: ProfileForm) {\n  return form.field({ name: 'name' }, (field) => html`\n    <input .value=${field.value} />\n  `)\n}","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"toptions","text":"TOptions","level":3},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype LitFormType<TOptions> = TOptions extends FormOptions<infer TFormData, infer TFormValidators, infer TSubmitReturn, unknown> ? TanStackFormController<TFormData, TFormValidators, LitFormTypeSubmitReturn<TSubmitReturn>> : never;\n```\n\nDefined in: [get-form-type.ts:58](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/lit-form/src/get-form-type.ts#L58)\n\nDerives the Lit form controller type represented by a reusable options\nobject.\n\nUse it to type child element properties and render helpers that belong to one\nknown form shape. Options such as `onSubmit` can be defined either in the\nshared options or when the form is created in the component.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TOptions\n\n`TOptions` *extends* `AnyFormOptions`\n\nThe reusable form options from which the controller derives its form data, validator, and submit-result types.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst profileOptions = formOptions({\n  defaultValues: { name: '' },\n})\n\ntype ProfileForm = LitFormType<typeof profileOptions>\n\nfunction nameField(form: ProfileForm) {\n  return form.field({ name: 'name' }, (field) => html`\n    <input .value=${field.value} />\n  `)\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: LitFormType\ntitle: LitFormType\n---\n\n```ts\ntype LitFormType<TOptions> = TOptions extends FormOptions<infer TFormData, infer TFormValidators, infer TSubmitReturn, unknown> ? TanStackFormController<TFormData, TFormValidators, LitFormTypeSubmitReturn<TSubmitReturn>> : never;\n```\n\nDefined in: [get-form-type.ts:58](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/lit-form/src/get-form-type.ts#L58)\n\nDerives the Lit form controller type represented by a reusable options\nobject.\n\nUse it to type child element properties and render helpers that belong to one\nknown form shape. Options such as `onSubmit` can be defined either in the\nshared options or when the form is created in the component.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TOptions\n\n`TOptions` *extends* `AnyFormOptions`\n\nThe reusable form options from which the controller derives its form data, validator, and submit-result types.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst profileOptions = formOptions({\n  defaultValues: { name: '' },\n})\n\ntype ProfileForm = LitFormType<typeof profileOptions>\n\nfunction nameField(form: ProfileForm) {\n  return form.field({ name: 'name' }, (field) => html`\n    <input .value=${field.value} />\n  `)\n}\n```\n"}
